| ----------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------- |
| ⭐ **Star Schema**       | **YES – Primary design**                                      | Fact table surrounded by dimensions                               |
| ❄️ **Snowflake Schema** | **NO – Not primary**                                          | Dimensions are normalized into additional tables                  |
| 🌌 **Galaxy Schema**    | **YES – Aspect**                                              | Multiple fact tables such as `fact_loans` and `fact_loan_summary` |
| **SCD Type 1**          | **YES**                                                       | `dim_customers`; history not maintained                           |
| **SCD Type 2**          | **YES**                                                       | `dim_branches`; history maintained                                |
| **ODS → EDW**           | **YES**                                                       | ODS tables feed dimensions/facts                                  |
| **Fact Tables**         | `fact_loans`, `fact_loan_summary`                             | Measures/business events                                          |
| **Dimension Tables**    | `dim_customers`, `dim_branches`, `dim_employees`, `dim_loans` | Descriptive information                                           |
| **Main fact source**    | `odsdb.ods_loans`                                             | Loan-level source                                                 |
| **Summary source**      | `fact_loans`                                                  | Aggregated from fact data                                         |


